Help.ListPane.Back:\Smove back to the previous test run.
Help.ListPane.Forward:\Smove forwards to the following test run.
Help.ListPane.Latest:\Sjump forwards to the most recent test run.
Help.ListPane.Run:\Supdate the test results to reflect any changes to the files on disc.|M\Aperform a complete re-run of all of the tests.
Help.ListPane.Contract:\Scontract all of the test files shown in the \w, so that just the file names are visible.
Help.ListPane.Expand:\Sexpand all of the entries in the test \w, so that all of the tests are visible.

